WEBVTT

STYLE
::cue(c.color9CD5FF) { color: #9CD5FF; }
::cue(c.colora8c7fa) { color: #a8c7fa; }
::cue(c.credits) { color: #a8c7fa; font-size: 78%; }

1
00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:07.000 line:5% align:center
<b><c.color9CD5FF>One Pace Premium</c></b>
Keep the project alive: <c.colora8c7fa>ko-fi.com/not6ip</c>

2
00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.780
Fight, crash through, and face the challenge!

3
00:00:04.780 --> 00:00:08.000
These are our hard knock days.

4
00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:12.830
Can't quench our thirst with a peaceful, everyday life.

5
00:00:12.830 --> 00:00:15.340
Here we go - don't ever run away!

6
00:00:15.340 --> 00:00:19.380
Let's go on living as the mighty winds take us!

7
00:00:19.380 --> 00:00:21.870
We've still got so far to go.

8
00:00:21.870 --> 00:00:26.390
Gotta keep going through the hard knock days.

9
00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:31.610
Let's do it again, yes, baby. How many times

10
00:00:31.610 --> 00:00:34.110
do I have to stand back up to make my dream come true?

11
00:00:34.110 --> 00:00:36.730
Feels like the strength of my resolve

12
00:00:36.730 --> 00:00:39.200
is put to the test everyday.

13
00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.700
Hey, let's go!

14
00:00:40.700 --> 00:00:44.450
I don't want to make excuses and settle for being mediocre.

15
00:00:44.450 --> 00:00:45.960
Hey, let's go!

16
00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:49.670
We leapt into a crazy, lawless world.

17
00:00:49.670 --> 00:00:54.170
As I struggled for a foothold, reality caught me off guard.

18
00:00:54.170 --> 00:00:59.470
Even if it beats me, hits me, knocks me down again,

19
00:00:59.470 --> 00:01:00.220
Oh!

20
00:01:00.220 --> 00:01:04.560
Only when we get back on our feet and look forward,

21
00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:07.450
will we have the last laugh, be the winners!

22
00:01:07.450 --> 00:01:10.120
We gotta go down this glory road, till we reach our goal!

23
00:01:10.120 --> 00:01:12.720
Fight, shake it off, act strong!

24
00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:15.720
These are our hard knock days.

25
00:01:15.720 --> 00:01:20.730
There's no such thing as a safe choice.

26
00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:23.060
Here we go - we'll always be the strongest!

27
00:01:23.060 --> 00:01:27.320
Let's keep moving - never mind the consequences.

28
00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.900
Let's put our wishes all together,

29
00:01:29.900 --> 00:01:34.910
and keep on going through the hard knock days.

30
00:01:49.070 --> 00:01:53.780
<b>Fourth Level - The Sunflower Field</b>

31
00:01:49.720 --> 00:01:51.840
Well? What are you gonna do?

32
00:01:51.920 --> 00:01:53.700
What are you gonna do?

33
00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:57.100
The ground is rippling like a flag.

34
00:01:57.360 --> 00:02:02.900
How pathetic! Just grovel in the dust, Toy Soldier!

35
00:02:03.430 --> 00:02:08.670
<b>Cabbage and Lomeo</b>

36
00:02:06.160 --> 00:02:08.800
I get it! It all makes sense now.

37
00:02:09.500 --> 00:02:13.920
The toy soldier who was crying and screaming so disgracefully back then...

38
00:02:14.100 --> 00:02:16.360
That was you!

39
00:02:23.840 --> 00:02:27.770
Scarlett!

40
00:02:30.160 --> 00:02:36.440
You're the late Scarlett's husband and Rebecca's father.

41
00:02:41.480 --> 00:02:43.140
This is great!

42
00:02:43.520 --> 00:02:47.660
Looks like you and I are bound by karma, eh Kyros?

43
00:02:48.400 --> 00:02:49.460
That's right!

44
00:02:49.990 --> 00:02:51.580
That's why I came here!

45
00:02:55.380 --> 00:02:58.940
Oh, oops... That was a good move!

46
00:02:59.100 --> 00:03:01.640
But it's a steel cape. Watch out!

47
00:03:04.940 --> 00:03:07.100
Vipera Glaive!
Snake Sword

48
00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:19.880
Father!

49
00:03:22.020 --> 00:03:24.340
Father, I'll fight, too!

50
00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:30.320
Yeah! Fight, Rebecca! I'll kill you!

51
00:03:33.260 --> 00:03:38.420
I wanna watch Kyros lose both his wife and daughter!

52
00:03:38.760 --> 00:03:39.980
It's okay, Rebecca!

53
00:03:40.220 --> 00:03:43.660
Let me protect you, as well as atone for Scarlett's death!

54
00:03:45.940 --> 00:03:50.680
Let me compensate for teaching you how to fight!

55
00:03:51.440 --> 00:03:55.030
I've been living with regret and shame for it until today!

56
00:03:57.500 --> 00:04:03.800
Now that I've become human once more,
I will never let my daughter swing a sword again!

57
00:04:16.480 --> 00:04:18.640
Th-This is terrible...

58
00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:22.650
<b>Royal Palace Grounds - Second Level</b>

59
00:04:19.420 --> 00:04:22.300
Lao G-sama was taken out!

60
00:04:23.260 --> 00:04:25.660
That's some power.

61
00:04:28.160 --> 00:04:30.480
I've heard that name before.

62
00:04:30.780 --> 00:04:33.260
The Happou Navy from the Flower Kingdom.

63
00:04:33.760 --> 00:04:34.920
I'll keep it in mind.

64
00:04:35.100 --> 00:04:37.600
Anyone can become our enemy at any time.

65
00:04:38.440 --> 00:04:40.940
Gramps! Hey, Gramps!

66
00:04:41.060 --> 00:04:42.980
Don't die, Gramps!

67
00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:47.040
Then I'll reserve two ceremonial halls, honey!

68
00:04:47.380 --> 00:04:49.360
Ceremonial halls?! Honey?!

69
00:04:49.460 --> 00:04:51.560
For the wedding and...

70
00:04:51.740 --> 00:04:53.060
the funeral.

71
00:04:53.200 --> 00:04:54.400
Don't write us off!

72
00:04:55.580 --> 00:04:58.360
<b>Royal Palace Grounds - Third Level</b>

73
00:04:58.620 --> 00:05:02.040
Why are you crawling and slinking around?

74
00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.680
Now, fight me, Gladius!

75
00:05:06.060 --> 00:05:07.600
Don't push your luck.

76
00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.080
What the...

77
00:05:18.360 --> 00:05:20.980
No! Gladius-sama, you can't!

78
00:05:25.780 --> 00:05:27.900
The ground is inflating!?

79
00:05:29.550 --> 00:05:31.420
You know what'll happen, don't you?

80
00:05:31.890 --> 00:05:34.440
You were preparing for this?

81
00:05:38.200 --> 00:05:40.080
Watch out!

82
00:05:40.200 --> 00:05:41.810
Run!

83
00:05:43.800 --> 00:05:46.720
Hey, Bartolomeo! Everything's gonna blow!

84
00:05:47.020 --> 00:05:48.440
Let me inside your barrier!

85
00:05:48.580 --> 00:05:49.570
No way!

86
00:05:49.720 --> 00:05:50.420
What?!

87
00:05:50.580 --> 00:05:55.260
If I open it, Robin-senpai and I will be in danger, and our enemies will come inside as well!

88
00:05:55.500 --> 00:05:58.500
No, open it! I'm on your side!

89
00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:01.440
Gladius-sama! We'll be caught up in it, too...

90
00:06:01.560 --> 00:06:04.620
It'll be fine. You guys are elite, right?

91
00:06:05.400 --> 00:06:07.020
Open up!

92
00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:09.200
Pop Rock...

93
00:06:09.870 --> 00:06:10.830
Festival!

94
00:06:28.550 --> 00:06:30.560
Goodbye, Cavendish.

95
00:06:37.700 --> 00:06:40.740
If I'd been outside right now, I'd be a dead man.

96
00:06:44.600 --> 00:06:45.520
You ingrate!

97
00:06:45.620 --> 00:06:47.540
Why'd you wait so long to let me in?!

98
00:06:47.600 --> 00:06:48.920
I thought I was gonna die!

99
00:06:49.860 --> 00:06:51.240
What's wrong with you?!

100
00:06:51.500 --> 00:06:54.260
That's no way to talk to the guy who just saved your life!

101
00:06:54.340 --> 00:06:57.640
I was covering you before that! Now we're even!

102
00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:01.440
I've had enough! I'm going to attack them!

103
00:07:01.540 --> 00:07:02.420
Let me out!

104
00:07:02.520 --> 00:07:03.620
What?!

105
00:07:03.740 --> 00:07:06.840
I just let you in, and now you want out?!

106
00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:10.900
Since you came in, why don't you stay for a while, you selfish fool?!

107
00:07:11.020 --> 00:07:12.220
Is this an inn?!

108
00:07:12.320 --> 00:07:14.980
Offense must come after defense!
That's how it should be!

109
00:07:17.640 --> 00:07:19.360
I won't let you in next time!

110
00:07:19.560 --> 00:07:21.720
Let me in again when I'm in danger!

111
00:07:22.040 --> 00:07:23.960
You're so unreasonable!

112
00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:27.360
I'll get you for this later!

113
00:07:28.180 --> 00:07:29.890
Oh yeah, Robin-senpai!

114
00:07:37.900 --> 00:07:40.770
Oh, great! She's alright!

115
00:07:40.940 --> 00:07:43.610
I'll be there, Rebecca! Stay safe!

116
00:07:46.220 --> 00:07:48.960
Nico Robin, you cumbersome woman!

117
00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:54.140
I won't let you get in the way of the top commanders anymore!

118
00:07:54.540 --> 00:07:56.300
Catapult Pop!

119
00:08:01.420 --> 00:08:04.180
Bari-ability: Racket!

120
00:08:13.220 --> 00:08:15.280
He's still alive?!

121
00:08:15.420 --> 00:08:18.540
Advance! Robin-senpai!

122
00:08:18.720 --> 00:08:19.640
Rooster-kun!

123
00:08:20.600 --> 00:08:21.430
Thank you!

124
00:08:21.580 --> 00:08:25.060
S-She made an eye gesture, a.k.a. a wink!

125
00:08:27.680 --> 00:08:30.580
I'm so grateful!

126
00:08:30.680 --> 00:08:36.760
Did it mean, "Good job, Rooster-kun! You can become my slave if you want"?!

127
00:08:36.840 --> 00:08:41.940
No no, you're being too presumptuous, Bartolomeo! You're asking for too much!

128
00:08:42.160 --> 00:08:43.340
But!

129
00:08:43.480 --> 00:08:46.370
I'm getting real fired up!

130
00:08:51.860 --> 00:08:53.880
Cavendish, you were in the barrier, too?!

131
00:08:54.040 --> 00:08:55.880
Too bad, Gladius!

132
00:08:56.140 --> 00:08:57.630
Blade of Beauty: Blue...

133
00:08:57.630 --> 00:08:58.740
Bracchium...

134
00:08:58.930 --> 00:09:01.030
Gladius-sama!

135
00:09:09.880 --> 00:09:11.120
Bartolomeo!

136
00:09:12.600 --> 00:09:15.280
Barrier Bulls!

137
00:09:16.520 --> 00:09:18.640
The barrier is charging at us!

138
00:09:18.760 --> 00:09:25.660
Robin-senpai! To a man, your eye gesture is worth risking his life!

139
00:09:31.500 --> 00:09:35.020
Stop, Bartolomeo! Can't you see I'm here?!

140
00:09:35.140 --> 00:09:38.500
Sorry, Cabbage! But there's a reason I can't stop!

141
00:09:38.620 --> 00:09:39.760
And that is?!

142
00:09:40.340 --> 00:09:43.820
I'm... so fired up!

143
00:09:43.960 --> 00:09:45.000
I don't care!

144
00:09:45.080 --> 00:09:47.300
What are you talking about, you fool?!
Stop now!

145
00:09:47.380 --> 00:09:48.660
No can do!

146
00:09:51.240 --> 00:09:52.080
Dellinger!

147
00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:55.340
Haven't you cleaned up the second level yet?!

148
00:09:55.500 --> 00:09:58.040
Gladius! What are you doing?

149
00:09:58.340 --> 00:10:00.260
I'll be finished here soon!

150
00:10:00.520 --> 00:10:02.240
Come and help on the third level!

151
00:10:02.660 --> 00:10:04.720
Nico Robin is trying to make her way up!

152
00:10:05.190 --> 00:10:07.520
My hands are full with these two idiots!

153
00:10:08.380 --> 00:10:10.960
Roger! Sounds like fun!

154
00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:15.720
Didn't I tell you...

155
00:10:18.100 --> 00:10:19.440
to pay attention?!

156
00:10:19.620 --> 00:10:22.540
Boy, you're so persistent, you Longhand!

157
00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:30.680
I did think those protrusions on your shoulders were weird.

158
00:10:31.620 --> 00:10:34.560
You got a hole in your damn stomach!

159
00:10:34.700 --> 00:10:37.400
So why don't you drop dead already, Martial Arts Champion?

160
00:10:37.640 --> 00:10:39.290
I can't do that!

161
00:10:39.680 --> 00:10:42.260
You gotta have a sense of duty and obligation in a man's world!

162
00:10:42.730 --> 00:10:45.580
I must fight for the sake of those who have already fallen!

163
00:10:46.320 --> 00:10:47.880
That's so not you.

164
00:10:48.840 --> 00:10:52.060
If you played dead or something, I would've spared your life.

165
00:10:53.380 --> 00:10:55.980
How will staying on your feet help?!

166
00:10:58.280 --> 00:11:00.360
Maybe I can buy some time.

167
00:11:00.480 --> 00:11:05.660
We've gotta keep you guys from getting in Straw Hat's way...

168
00:11:05.780 --> 00:11:08.700
so that he can defeat Doflamingo!

169
00:11:08.820 --> 00:11:10.680
We'll do it together!

170
00:11:11.480 --> 00:11:15.980
There's no such thing as victory attained by one person alone, kid!

171
00:11:20.780 --> 00:11:23.940
So you guys are trying to attain victory
by sacrificing your lives.

172
00:11:27.020 --> 00:11:28.900
That's how vermin act!

173
00:11:29.820 --> 00:11:32.480
The strong don't heed obligations!

174
00:12:05.960 --> 00:12:08.740
I'm no ordinary human, either.

175
00:12:10.400 --> 00:12:14.820
Don't underestimate my Fighting Fish lineage!

176
00:12:26.340 --> 00:12:28.120
<b>3rd step</b>

177
00:12:33.320 --> 00:12:36.320
Gladius! I'm here!

178
00:12:36.880 --> 00:12:38.240
Where are you?

179
00:12:43.640 --> 00:12:45.340
Gladius!

180
00:12:45.800 --> 00:12:48.520
Dellinger, stay on the lower level!
It's dangerous here!

181
00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:50.980
We have one troublesome enemy!

182
00:12:52.860 --> 00:12:54.460
That doesn't sound like you!

183
00:12:54.580 --> 00:12:58.180
Gladius, nobody can oppose us when we fight together-

184
00:13:07.920 --> 00:13:08.880
Dellinger!

185
00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:29.480
Damn! Dellinger...

186
00:13:32.600 --> 00:13:33.760
What the...

187
00:13:33.980 --> 00:13:35.580
What just happened?!

188
00:13:35.840 --> 00:13:40.240
That brat with horns and all the other enemy soldiers...

189
00:13:41.020 --> 00:13:42.840
He took 'em all down.

190
00:13:47.400 --> 00:13:50.880
There's this kinda scary guy on the other side of the barrier!

191
00:13:55.620 --> 00:13:58.160
Wh-Who's that?

192
00:13:59.420 --> 00:14:04.400
He looks like Cabbage, but his face is totally different.

193
00:14:14.840 --> 00:14:20.380
This is exactly the same thing that happened in the Block D match at the Colosseum.

194
00:14:20.840 --> 00:14:25.480
Oh my, everyone's gone down!

195
00:14:33.940 --> 00:14:36.760
That was this guy's doing?

196
00:14:36.960 --> 00:14:40.000
Those clothes are undoubtedly Cavendish's.

197
00:14:40.400 --> 00:14:43.180
But the face looks undoubtedly like somebody else-dish.

198
00:14:43.340 --> 00:14:46.540
So what kinda-vendish is he?

199
00:14:50.540 --> 00:14:52.720
T-That scared me!

200
00:14:52.900 --> 00:14:54.840
He was so fast, I couldn't see him!

201
00:14:55.700 --> 00:15:01.660
Well, no matter how fast you can move, it's useless against my ability!

202
00:15:01.820 --> 00:15:03.980
What the hell're you thinking?!

203
00:15:04.140 --> 00:15:07.500
What's happened to you?!
If you take this joke too far...

204
00:15:14.480 --> 00:15:17.640
Hey! Who did you just glance at?!

205
00:15:17.760 --> 00:15:21.040
Don't do anything stupid! Hey! Hey!

206
00:15:26.420 --> 00:15:29.520
Don't!

207
00:15:32.260 --> 00:15:36.000
Don't go after Robin-senpai!

208
00:15:53.100 --> 00:15:55.300
Your speed is useless against me.

209
00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:58.680
Your face has become quite ugly.

210
00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:01.780
Cabbage-kun, did you want something from me?

211
00:16:08.560 --> 00:16:12.800
I'm worried about Rebecca, so I must hurry to the top.

212
00:16:16.320 --> 00:16:20.280
Wow! Cool! She stopped him!

213
00:16:20.430 --> 00:16:23.920
Dobin-sedbai!

214
00:16:25.060 --> 00:16:31.460
I knew it was too audacious of a weakling like me to try to protect you!

215
00:16:45.140 --> 00:16:46.740
Wait, Hakuba!

216
00:16:50.960 --> 00:16:54.960
I didn't give you permission to come out!

217
00:16:59.120 --> 00:17:01.580
I'm sorry, Nico Robin.

218
00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:03.600
I almost cut you.

219
00:17:03.760 --> 00:17:06.200
So that was this "Hakuba" I've heard about.

220
00:17:06.860 --> 00:17:08.140
Your other personality...

221
00:17:09.920 --> 00:17:10.960
That's right...

222
00:17:12.960 --> 00:17:14.660
He's bad news.

223
00:17:14.860 --> 00:17:17.240
He kills indiscrimi-

224
00:17:22.440 --> 00:17:24.300
Your hands and feet...

225
00:17:24.990 --> 00:17:29.600
I'll chop them and what's left of you into bits, Nico Robin!

226
00:17:30.330 --> 00:17:32.620
I'll slice up everything!

227
00:17:37.660 --> 00:17:41.020
Stay away, Hakuba! I won't let you take control!

228
00:17:42.700 --> 00:17:45.820
Shut up! Stay asleep, Cavendish!

229
00:17:46.300 --> 00:17:49.160
You don't even know what I'm fighting for!

230
00:17:49.300 --> 00:17:50.520
I'll take care of this!

231
00:17:51.060 --> 00:17:53.160
I'll just rip everything to shreds!

232
00:17:53.260 --> 00:17:55.300
There's no point if I don't do it!

233
00:17:55.400 --> 00:17:58.010
Don't care! I'll show them a bloodbath!

234
00:17:58.100 --> 00:18:02.360
It's like two people having a conversation! Does he have a split personality?!

235
00:18:02.420 --> 00:18:03.140
I will!

236
00:18:03.320 --> 00:18:04.200
No, me!

237
00:18:04.480 --> 00:18:05.550
I'll do it!

238
00:18:05.550 --> 00:18:06.550
No, I will!

239
00:18:06.550 --> 00:18:07.380
I will!

240
00:18:07.760 --> 00:18:09.850
Me, me, me!

241
00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:11.970
I will, I will, I will !

242
00:18:12.100 --> 00:18:12.680
Me!

243
00:18:12.680 --> 00:18:13.240
I will!

244
00:18:13.480 --> 00:18:13.940
Me!

245
00:18:13.960 --> 00:18:14.520
I will!

246
00:18:14.780 --> 00:18:15.350
Me!

247
00:18:15.350 --> 00:18:15.980
I will!

248
00:18:16.220 --> 00:18:17.020
Me!

249
00:18:18.120 --> 00:18:19.060
I will! Me!

250
00:18:19.200 --> 00:18:22.220
He's gone half-and-half!

251
00:18:25.040 --> 00:18:26.620
Shut up, Hakuba!

252
00:18:28.480 --> 00:18:30.980
I'm the only Cavendish!

253
00:18:31.560 --> 00:18:34.460
You were half-and-half just a second ago!

254
00:18:37.100 --> 00:18:40.280
Okay, it's alright now, Nico Robin.

255
00:18:40.600 --> 00:18:42.620
Why don't you let go of me?

256
00:18:42.880 --> 00:18:45.540
You expect me to trust you after seeing that?

257
00:18:50.120 --> 00:18:50.780
Huh?

258
00:18:51.520 --> 00:18:53.840
Let's just end this now.

259
00:18:58.660 --> 00:19:01.120
I'll blow you up along with the wall!

260
00:19:02.220 --> 00:19:04.620
This'll do far worse than just throw you into the air.

261
00:19:04.930 --> 00:19:07.140
You're not getting away in one piece!

262
00:19:09.860 --> 00:19:11.340
That bastard!

263
00:19:11.480 --> 00:19:13.240
He'll rupture us along with the wall!

264
00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:17.180
We need to get down right now, Nico Robin!

265
00:19:17.340 --> 00:19:21.340
No! Something could happen to Rebecca while I'm doing that...

266
00:19:21.460 --> 00:19:23.400
Leave this to me!

267
00:19:24.560 --> 00:19:28.300
I won't let him harm Robin-senpai!

268
00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:29.720
Good judgment.

269
00:19:30.220 --> 00:19:34.420
Yes, if you take me down, you can stop the wall from rupturing.

270
00:19:36.960 --> 00:19:38.640
Punk Hair!

271
00:19:48.460 --> 00:19:50.160
What's this? It went numb.

272
00:19:50.960 --> 00:19:52.700
Those hairs are poison needles.

273
00:19:52.830 --> 00:19:53.390
What?!

274
00:19:53.390 --> 00:19:54.460
Bartolomeo!

275
00:19:54.840 --> 00:19:57.240
I have the power of the Rupture Fruit.

276
00:20:02.200 --> 00:20:05.540
In other words, I'm a rupture man from head to toe.

277
00:20:09.670 --> 00:20:12.660
If you do something to me, my body will explode...

278
00:20:13.720 --> 00:20:17.420
and thousands more of the poison needles that just caught you...

279
00:20:18.040 --> 00:20:20.180
will pierce through those two up there!

280
00:20:23.720 --> 00:20:28.000
But if you don't take me down, you can't stop the wall from rupturing.

281
00:20:28.360 --> 00:20:29.900
What are you gonna do?

282
00:20:30.220 --> 00:20:34.700
My body's explosion will be so powerful that you can't survive, of course.

283
00:20:35.000 --> 00:20:39.640
Then Robin-senpai will suffer no matter what I do!

284
00:20:39.860 --> 00:20:42.860
You're a fast learner, Bartolomeo.

285
00:20:44.180 --> 00:20:46.140
Think, Bartolomeo!

286
00:20:46.250 --> 00:20:50.080
What's the most important thing for me to keep safe here?

287
00:20:51.760 --> 00:20:53.320
That's obviously...

288
00:20:53.840 --> 00:20:55.900
Robin-senpai's body.

289
00:20:56.380 --> 00:20:58.840
To stop the wall from rupturing,

290
00:20:59.160 --> 00:21:01.640
I've gotta take that hedgehog down.

291
00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:07.080
But then, all those poison needles will fly straight toward Robin-senpai!

292
00:21:08.900 --> 00:21:12.040
What should I do? Think!

293
00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:14.860
Think harder, Bartolomeo!

294
00:21:18.020 --> 00:21:19.100
Oh yeah!

295
00:21:19.400 --> 00:21:23.760
There's a completely expendable guy up there with Robin-senpai!

296
00:21:24.170 --> 00:21:28.640
Hey, Cabbage! I'll bring down the hedgehog here, so...

297
00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:33.890
you protect Robin-senpai from the poison needles by using your whole body as a shield!

298
00:21:34.780 --> 00:21:35.640
Hey...

299
00:21:35.760 --> 00:21:36.560
Hey, Cabbage!

300
00:21:36.660 --> 00:21:38.380
Shut up, rooster!

301
00:21:38.580 --> 00:21:41.160
The evil one came out again!

302
00:21:41.340 --> 00:21:44.580
Just when I need him the most, he's useless!

303
00:21:47.770 --> 00:21:50.700
Robin-senpai's in danger from all sides!

304
00:21:50.930 --> 00:21:52.520
What do I do?! What do I do?!

305
00:21:54.620 --> 00:21:55.820
Oh yeah!

306
00:22:11.940 --> 00:22:13.710
Will you face me, Bartolomeo?

307
00:22:13.860 --> 00:22:16.420
I can only put up one barrier at a time.

308
00:22:17.500 --> 00:22:20.080
That's the drawback, but I don't care.

309
00:22:24.220 --> 00:22:29.460
Robin-senpai! If I can save you, I won't hesitate!

310
00:22:32.520 --> 00:22:34.460
Barrier Ball!

311
00:22:34.800 --> 00:22:37.540
Go ahead, blow up if you like!

312
00:22:37.720 --> 00:22:40.760
We're inside my unbreakable barrier!

313
00:22:40.880 --> 00:22:41.600
This fool...

314
00:22:48.260 --> 00:22:50.800
Rooster-kun! Don't tell me you...

315
00:22:53.640 --> 00:22:56.180
You were prepared to take me down with you?!

316
00:22:56.420 --> 00:22:57.620
You insolent little...

317
00:22:58.820 --> 00:23:00.500
Fashion Pop!

318
00:23:06.500 --> 00:23:07.700
Rooster-kun!

319
00:23:08.220 --> 00:23:11.360
That serves you right, hedgehog!

320
00:23:11.800 --> 00:23:16.000
Now the wall won't rupture!

321
00:23:17.920 --> 00:23:19.480
I did it...

322
00:23:19.840 --> 00:23:23.300
I protected Robin-senpai.

323
00:23:32.400 --> 00:23:34.760
Too bad for you, fool.

324
00:23:37.620 --> 00:23:39.620
You missed by just a few centimeters.

325
00:23:40.520 --> 00:23:44.710
It wasn't my throat that you stabbed. It was my shoulder.

326
00:23:45.720 --> 00:23:47.420
I-I missed his vital organs?!

327
00:23:47.700 --> 00:23:51.940
Sure, he was inflated and I couldn't tell if it was his neck or shoulder but...

328
00:23:52.270 --> 00:23:53.760
Dammit!

329
00:23:54.300 --> 00:23:58.400
You have Devil Fruit powers too,
so you know the deal.

330
00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:01.800
As long as I'm conscious...

331
00:24:04.650 --> 00:24:07.060
The wall rupture won't stop!

332
00:24:08.580 --> 00:24:12.780
Watch closely as your friends are blown asunder!

333
00:24:12.940 --> 00:24:17.760
Damn, I'm such a fool!

334
00:24:21.040 --> 00:24:22.960
Nico Robin, I'm sorry!

335
00:24:23.540 --> 00:24:25.060
I brought Hakuba under control!

336
00:24:25.320 --> 00:24:27.120
I'm Cavendish now!

337
00:24:27.720 --> 00:24:30.360
But I left half of me as Hakuba.

338
00:24:30.820 --> 00:24:34.040
Let go of me! I'll kill you!

339
00:24:34.980 --> 00:24:38.520
I'll take you to the Sunflower Field with Hakuba's speed!

340
00:24:38.880 --> 00:24:41.020
I'll use Hakuba's abilities!

341
00:24:41.420 --> 00:24:43.980
We have no other options! Let go of me!

342
00:24:44.220 --> 00:24:45.810
Trust me!

343
00:24:46.980 --> 00:24:47.840
Which one's talking?

344
00:24:48.000 --> 00:24:49.610
No time to think!

345
00:24:50.300 --> 00:24:51.280
Hurry up!

346
00:24:52.140 --> 00:24:53.740
D-Don't!

347
00:24:53.820 --> 00:24:54.820
Pop Rock...

348
00:24:59.160 --> 00:25:00.860
Super Arena!

349
00:25:05.080 --> 00:25:08.160
Robin-senpai!

350
00:25:11.480 --> 00:25:14.160
This barrier of yours is quite convenient.

351
00:25:23.120 --> 00:25:24.410
Look.

352
00:25:25.560 --> 00:25:27.760
There's nothing left of either one.

353
00:25:28.000 --> 00:25:28.740
Huh?!

354
00:25:33.260 --> 00:25:34.760
Why did you stop me?!

355
00:25:35.040 --> 00:25:36.960
It's your own body!

356
00:25:37.920 --> 00:25:40.100
If so, why don't you...

357
00:25:40.520 --> 00:25:43.080
listen to me every now and then?!

358
00:25:45.820 --> 00:25:48.640
Cien Fleur! Spider Net!
Hundred Flower Spider Net

359
00:25:55.000 --> 00:25:58.740
You stopped Hakuba's sword for me, didn't you, Cabbage-kun?

360
00:26:00.600 --> 00:26:02.040
You're such a confusing man.

361
00:26:04.400 --> 00:26:05.560
Impossible!

362
00:26:05.860 --> 00:26:08.180
How could they escape that rupture?!

363
00:26:14.000 --> 00:26:18.280
Compared to him, I'm pathetic!

364
00:26:19.820 --> 00:26:21.600
Divine Homage Fist!

365
00:26:24.960 --> 00:26:26.440
Luffy-senpai...

366
00:26:26.760 --> 00:26:29.640
My skills aren't good enough now...

367
00:26:29.780 --> 00:26:32.390
But I'll become stronger and stronger...

368
00:26:32.860 --> 00:26:35.040
Barrier...

369
00:26:40.660 --> 00:26:42.540
I swear, that someday...

370
00:26:42.880 --> 00:26:48.490
I'll become a man who can help you!

371
00:26:50.920 --> 00:26:53.520
Pistol!

372
00:27:09.910 --> 00:27:13.890
I barely won using my senpai's power...

373
00:27:15.640 --> 00:27:19.760
Anyway, I never want to...

374
00:27:19.960 --> 00:27:22.120
work with that annoying guy again!

375
00:27:24.620 --> 00:27:28.000
<b>4th Step
Sunflower Hill</b>

376
00:27:30.400 --> 00:27:32.740
It's quite noisy down there, too.

377
00:27:33.280 --> 00:27:35.580
On an unstable battlefield like this,

378
00:27:35.680 --> 00:27:39.780
even a gladiator from the Colosseum would totter and fall!

379
00:27:40.060 --> 00:27:42.160
Right, Rebecca?

380
00:27:42.720 --> 00:27:44.760
Vipera Glaive!
Snake Sword

381
00:27:44.920 --> 00:27:48.740
Don't!
Run, Rebecca! You can't stop that attack!

382
00:27:50.140 --> 00:27:52.100
Butterfly flowers that divert attacks...

383
00:27:52.220 --> 00:27:53.260
Mil Fleur!
Thousand Flower

384
00:27:57.760 --> 00:27:58.840
Moth Orchid!

385
00:28:00.020 --> 00:28:01.080
Robin-san!

386
00:28:02.260 --> 00:28:03.140
That's...

387
00:28:03.300 --> 00:28:04.300
Robiland!

388
00:28:04.880 --> 00:28:08.260
You've completed your objective, Rebecca.

389
00:28:09.640 --> 00:28:11.860
Thank you for delivering the key.

390
00:28:12.260 --> 00:28:14.620
From now on, I'll defend you!
